    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks but talking to people just feels like another chore on the list. like i have to perform being 'okay' for them. i'm just so burnt out on everything. the debt is piling up and i can't see a way out that doesn't involve me just constantly struggling for nothing. it feels like the math of my life just doesn't add up anymore. it's like there's no logical way to win.",
