      "content": "self-care feels like a joke when the walls are closing in. like, what is the point of a \"sliver of relief\" if i just wake up tomorrow and it's all exactly the same? the debt, the exhaustion, the feeling that i'm just a drain on everyone... i don't want a bandaid. i want the noise to stop. i just want a way to make the pressure actually go away for good.",
